---
import { sitePath } from '../data/paths';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PricingCards from '../components/PricingCards.astro';
import AccessMap from '../components/AccessMap.astro';
import { pricing, yen } from '../data/site';
import { homeImages, homeServices } from '../data/home';
---
<BaseLayout title="Motorcycle support for riders living in Japan" description="Own and ride a motorcycle in Japan? Explore eFactory’s workshop support, custom parts and ECU Flashing services in Suzuka. Welcoming riders from across Japan. Tax-inclusive prices.">
  <section class="hero container home-revised" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> FOR YOUR MOTORCYCLE LIFE IN JAPAN</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Your Bike.<br />Your Project.<br /><span>We're Here to Help.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-description">Motorcycle maintenance, customization and technical support in Suzuka, Japan—for riders from across Japan.</p>
      <p class="hero-detail">Make more of the bike you own and ride in Japan. Bring your project to a workshop with tools, equipment and practical know-how, and work through the next step with eFactory.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href={sitePath('/contact/')}>Plan your first visit <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a class="secondary-link" href={sitePath('/services/')}>Explore our services <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      <div class="hero-facts"><span><strong>{yen(pricing.first.total)}</strong> first visit · {pricing.first.minutes} min<br />Total session price · incl. tax</span><span>Suzuka, Japan<br /><strong>By appointment only</strong></span></div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-media">
      <Image class="hero-photo" src={homeImages.workshop} alt="The eFactory workshop, with a blue motorcycle, tools and the eFactory sign—the same photograph used on the Japanese HOME" format="png" width={1200} widths={[480, 800, 1200]} sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 960px) 45vw, 550px" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
      <figcaption class="media-caption"><span class="caption-index">THE EFACTORY WORKSHOP</span><p>Based in Suzuka.<br /><strong>Welcoming riders from across Japan.</strong></p></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>
  <div class="principles-strip"><div class="container"><span>YOUR BIKE & YOUR GOALS</span><span>TOOLS & EQUIPMENT</span><span>PRACTICAL SUPPORT</span><span>BY APPOINTMENT</span></div></div>
  <section class="section container" aria-labelledby="start-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A PLACE TO START</p><h2 id="start-title">What brings you here?</h2></div><p>Keep it running. Make it your own.<br />Find the support your project needs.</p></div>
    <div class="entry-grid">
      <a class="entry-card" href={sitePath('/services/#repair-support')}><span class="entry-number">01 / SOMETHING’S NOT RIGHT</span><h3>“My bike needs help.”</h3><p>A fall, damaged parts or something that doesn’t feel right. Enquire about a visit to check the bike and agree on a way forward.</p><span class="card-link">Explore repair support <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a>
      <a class="entry-card entry-orange" href={sitePath('/services/#diy-support')}><span class="entry-number">02 / READY TO TRY</span><h3>“I want to do it myself.”</h3><p>Want to maintain or customize your bike, but need equipment or guidance? Work on an agreed task with practical support alongside you.</p><span class="card-link">Explore hands-on support <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a>
    </div>
    <p class="approach-note"><span aria-hidden="true">+</span> Supported DIY keeps you involved in your own motorcycle. Who performs each task depends on the service: staff operate the tyre changer, while fabrication and ECU work have their own scope. Technical consultation is a paid service.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="pricing-section section" aria-labelledby="pricing-title"><div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">TOTAL PRICES. TAX INCLUDED.</p><h2 id="pricing-title">Choose your next step.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/pricing/')}>All pricing & membership <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
    <PricingCards />
    <div class="membership-strip"><div><span class="eyebrow">ONGOING SUPPORT</span><h3>A place to keep coming back to.</h3></div><p>Standard <strong>{yen(pricing.memberships[0].monthly)}<span>/ month</span></strong><span>Total membership price · incl. tax</span></p><p>Premium <strong>{yen(pricing.memberships[1].monthly)}<span>/ month</span></strong><span>Total membership price · incl. tax</span></p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/pricing/#membership')}>Membership details <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
    <p class="price-note membership-note">Confirm current membership eligibility, benefits, session allowances and terms before joining. Separately charged parts and specialist work are not included in these monthly prices.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section container" aria-labelledby="services-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A WORKSHOP FOR YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2 id="services-title">Maintain it. Improve it. Understand it.</h2></div><p>Practical equipment and specialist knowledge,<br />with the scope agreed for your project.</p></div>
    <div class="service-grid home-services">{homeServices.map((service, index) => <a class="service-card" href={sitePath(service.href)}>
      <Image class="service-image" src={service.image} alt={service.alt} width={120} widths={[120, 240]} sizes="(max-width: 600px) 72px, 96px" format="png" loading="lazy" />
      <span class="service-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')} / {service.label}</span><h3>{service.title}</h3><p>{service.text}</p><span class="card-link">Explore this service <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
    </a>)}</div>
    <p class="service-scope-note">Available tasks depend on your motorcycle, chosen plan, required equipment and preparation. Confirm membership requirements and any separate charges before booking.</p>
    <div class="parts-grid">
      <a class="parts-card" href={sitePath('/services/#ssb-cst')}><Image src={homeImages.ssbLogo} alt="SSB Sakuta Sports Bumper logo, as shown on the Japanese eFactory HOME" width={180} widths={[180, 360]} format="png" loading="lazy" /><div><h3>SSB bumpers</h3><p>Ask about sales, fitting and repair for your motorcycle.</p><span class="card-link">Parts & fitting enquiries <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></a>
      <a class="parts-card" href={sitePath('/services/#ssb-cst')}><Image src={homeImages.cstTyres} alt="CST tyre product image used on the Japanese eFactory HOME" width={140} widths={[140, 280]} format="png" loading="lazy" /><div><Image class="cst-logo" src={homeImages.cstLogo} alt="CST" width={80} format="png" loading="lazy" /><h3>CST tyres</h3><p>Ask about availability, suitability and tyre-change support.</p><span class="card-link">Tyre enquiries <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-band"><div class="container about-band-inner home-about">
    <Image class="workshop-detail" src={homeImages.workshopDetail} alt="A red motorcycle beside tools in the eFactory workshop—the photograph used on the Japanese HOME" width={170} widths={[170, 340]} format="png" loading="lazy" />
    <div><p class="eyebrow">THE EFACTORY APPROACH</p><h2>Your goals.<br />Shared knowledge.</h2></div>
    <div><p>From learning a maintenance task to developing a custom part, eFactory helps you understand and improve your motorcycle. Agree on the work and the support you need, then take the next step together.</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/about/')}>Get to know eFactory <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section container visit-section" aria-labelledby="visit-title">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">TRAVELLING TO SUZUKA?</p><h2 id="visit-title">Plan the work<br />before the journey.</h2><p>Whether you live nearby or elsewhere in Japan, enquire before making travel plans. Confirm that your request fits the available services, what parts or preparation are needed, and the appointment.</p><p class="visit-language">Ask about arrangements for English enquiries, in-person explanations and technical consultation before booking. The available language support needs to be confirmed.</p><a class="button" href={sitePath('/contact/')}>Contact & plan your visit <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div>
    <ol class="visit-steps"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Share your bike & project</h3><p>Send your name, motorcycle model, intended task and preferred date through the official contact route.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Confirm the scope, preparation & costs</h3><p>Ask what your visit includes and what needs preparing. Booking enquiries are separate from paid technical advice and member consultation services.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Receive confirmation before travelling</h3><p>All visits are by appointment. Sending an enquiry does not secure a slot; wait until the appointment has been agreed.</p></div></li></ol>
  </section>
  <section class="section container home-access" aria-labelledby="access-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FIND THE WORKSHOP</p><h2 id="access-title">Your destination: Suzuka.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/contact/#access')}>Contact & access details <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div><AccessMap compact /></section>
</BaseLayout>
